---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Notice — Wisdom Technosoft"
  description="How Wisdom Technosoft handles details submitted through wisdomtechnosoft.com. Zero trackers, zero ad cookies, strict data governance."
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="blueprint-shell privacy-page" data-theme="paper">
    <header class="privacy-head border-b">
      <a class="brand font-mono" href="/" aria-label="Wisdom Technosoft Root">
        <img src="/assets/logo-mark.png" alt="Wisdom Technosoft" width="34" height="28" />
        <span>WISDOM TECHNOSOFT</span>
      </a>
      <a class="btn-industrial btn-outline-paper font-mono" href="/">&larr; BACK TO SITE</a>
    </header>

    <div class="section-meta-bar">
      <div class="meta-left">
        <span class="meta-index">[LEGAL // SPEC]</span>
        <span class="meta-tag">DATA GOVERNANCE &bull; PRIVACY PROTOCOL</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-right">
        <span class="meta-annotation font-mono">TRACKERS: 0 &bull; AD COOKIES: 0</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="privacy-content">
      <article class="privacy-article">
        <span class="tech-tag tech-tag-signal font-mono">DATA CONTRACT</span>
        <h1 class="privacy-title">Privacy Notice &amp; Data Governance</h1>
        <p class="privacy-lead">
          Wisdom Technosoft (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;) respects your privacy. This notice explains what happens to the information you share through <strong>wisdomtechnosoft.com</strong> and our contact form. It does not cover how we handle client project data once an engagement begins &mdash; that is governed by the specific contractual agreement and non-disclosure agreement (NDA) between us and the client.
        </p>

        <section class="privacy-block">
          <h2 class="block-title font-mono">[01] WHAT WE COLLECT</h2>
          <ul class="block-list">
            <li><strong>Contact form submissions:</strong> Your name, email address, optional phone number, chosen service area, and message content. These are solely utilized to respond directly to your technical inquiry.</li>
            <li><strong>Email &amp; Direct Inquiries:</strong> If you write to <a href="mailto:wisdomtechnosoft04@gmail.com">wisdomtechnosoft04@gmail.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+917447331127">+91 74473 31127</a>, correspondence history is retained exclusively for business communication.</li>
            <li><strong>Server Logs:</strong> Our edge hosting provider records standard HTTP request telemetry (IP address, timestamp, requested URL, user-agent) for network security and DDoS mitigation. This data is never monetized or linked to personal identities.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-block">
          <h2 class="block-title font-mono">[02] WHAT WE DO NOT DO</h2>
          <ul class="block-list">
            <li><strong>Zero advertising or behavioral tracking cookies:</strong> We do not track you across the web.</li>
            <li><strong>Zero third-party analytics pixels:</strong> No Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, or commercial tracker bloat.</li>
            <li><strong>No selling or leasing of data:</strong> Your contact information is never shared with third-party brokers or advertisers.</li>
            <li><strong>No automated behavioral profiling:</strong> Your project requirements are reviewed directly by technical leads.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-block">
          <h2 class="block-title font-mono">[03] RETENTION PERIODS</h2>
          <p>
            Contact-form submissions and correspondence are kept for as long as needed to respond to your inquiry and, if a project begins, for the duration of that project and any statutory record-keeping requirement. You may request deletion of your inquiry record at any time.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-block">
          <h2 class="block-title font-mono">[04] DATA RIGHTS &amp; CHOICES</h2>
          <p>
            You may request to inspect, correct, or delete any personal information you have submitted by dispatching an email to <a href="mailto:wisdomtechnosoft04@gmail.com">wisdomtechnosoft04@gmail.com</a>. We will process and confirm your request within 30 days.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-block">
          <h2 class="block-title font-mono">[05] INFRASTRUCTURE SECURITY</h2>
          <p>
            This website is encrypted and delivered exclusively over HTTPS with modern TLS cipher suites. We employ technical and organisational controls to safeguard transmitted information against loss, misuse, or unauthorised access.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-block">
          <h2 class="block-title font-mono">[06] POLICY MODIFICATIONS</h2>
          <p>
            If this notice is updated, changes will be published directly to this URL with an updated timestamp.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="privacy-timestamp font-mono">
          <span>LAST AUDITED: <time datetime="2026-10-26">26 OCTOBER 2026</time></span>
          <span>LOCATION: NAGPUR, MAHARASHTRA, INDIA</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </main>

    <footer class="privacy-footer border-t font-mono">
      <span>WISDOM TECHNOSOFT &bull; SYSTEM GOVERNANCE</span>
      <span><a href="/">&larr; RETURN TO HOME SPECIFICATION</a></span>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background-color: var(--bg-paper);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .privacy-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 16px var(--grid-pad);
    background: var(--bg-paper);
  }

  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .privacy-content {
    flex: 1;
    padding: clamp(48px, 8vw, 80px) var(--grid-pad);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .privacy-article {
    max-width: 780px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .privacy-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .privacy-lead {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .privacy-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-paper);
  }

  .block-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent-signal);
  }

  .block-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .block-list li {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }

  .block-list li::before {
    content: "+";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    color: var(--accent-signal);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .privacy-block p {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .privacy-block a,
  .block-list a {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .privacy-block a:hover,
  .block-list a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-signal);
  }

  .privacy-timestamp {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-paper);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .privacy-footer {
    padding: 16px var(--grid-pad);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
  }

  .privacy-footer a {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .privacy-footer a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-signal);
  }
</style>
